s loans to&nbsp;creditworthy farmers.</p>","updateDate":"2026-07-24T18:19:38Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Farm Credit Adjustment Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-07-24T18:26:56Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-24T18:26:56Z"}
